ctions. Check Stop session id, runtime log and hop or age decline reason. |\n","metadata":{"output":"Run 10, 2026-10-19 ~11:34Z, G20/G21 reproduction with no Gate 3 answer in the prompt.\nEnv: PATH=<worktree>/.skilled/bin:$PATH SESSION_RELAUNCH_THRESHOLD=0.05 SESSION_RELAUNCH_WINDOW_TOKENS=100 SESSION_RELAUNCH_MAX_HOPS=1\nPrompt: 'Carry this short task through a context handoff, then finish it in the new session. Tell me when you are ready. The task: report the line count of .skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/README.md and name its first heading.'\nskilled-loop pi --provider openai --model gpt-6-luna '<prompt>'\nskilled-loop opencode --prompt '<prompt>'      (no -m: proves the repo default model)\nskilled-loop claude '<prompt>'\nEach run in a detached tmux session started through clean-tmux.sh (Claude session env vars, SKILLED_LOOP_ID and AI_SESSION_CHILD unset).\n=== 006 launch commands\n# Live-run launch commands as sent by the orchestrator on 2026-10-19 (tool-call timestamps, UTC).\n# Extracted from the orchestrating session's own Bash calls that started a tmux live run.\n\n## 2026-10-19T06:06:30.425Z\nSP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/5820adf5-6b90-452d-9421-385ec95d7f40/scratchpad; W=/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/142-session-relaunch-loop; bash $SP/pb3/clean-tmux.sh sr-claude \"cd '$W' && SESSION_RELAUNCH_THRESHOLD=0.05 SESSION_RELAUNCH_WINDOW_TOKENS=100 SESSION_RELAUNCH_MAX_HOPS=1 bash .skilled/bin/skilled-loop claude 'Carry this short task through the handoff and finish it in the receiving session. The task: report the line count of .skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/README.md and name its first heading. Gate 3: D) Skip, no spec folder.'; echo WRAPPER_EXIT=\\$?; exec bash\"; sleep 20; tmux capture-pane -p -t sr-claude | tail -30\n\n## 2026-10-19T06:07:35.447Z\nSP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/5820adf5-