other user to pre-create it.\",\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-006\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"LUNA-002\",\"rationale\":\"On a shared temp directory, another account can pre-create the fixed name; the user's subsequent chmod fails on the other-owned directory.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:20,42-46,143-145\"],\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:20,42-46,143-145\",\"result\":\"The fallback uses os.tmpdir plus one fixed directory name, then chmods that path without checking owner.\"},{\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs:22-43\"],\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs:22-43\",\"result\":\"The common killer fixture supplies XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, so it does not exercise the shared-temp fallback.\"}],\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:20,42-46,143-145\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs:22-43\"]},{\"dimension\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"hypothesis\":\"A process may exit and its numeric PID may be reused after ancestry validation but before SIGTERM.\",\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-007\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"LUNA-003\",\"rationale\":\"The target identity is not bound across the validation-to-signal interval, so PID reuse could redirect the signal.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/killer.cjs:449-464\"],\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/killer.cjs:449-464\",\"result\":\"The ancestry check and liveness check use a numeric PID; a state-file read occurs before process.kill sends SIGTERM to the same number.\"}],\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/killer.cjs:449-464\"]},{\"dimension\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\",\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-008\",\"invariant\":\"A handoff path that resolves outside the trust