s applies strict evidence tracking to correctness targets.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:555-585\"]},\"targetSelection\":{\"selectedTargets\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/hermes/session-end-arm.mjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/claude/context-nudge.mjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/claude/stop-arm.mjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/bin/session-relaunch.cjs\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/pi/session-relaunch.ts\"],\"selectionReason\":\"Review the shared append producer, its adapters and wrapper callers, and its tests for write completion, line recovery, and permissions.\",\"discoveryMethods\":[\"direct_read\",\"exact_search\"],\"omittedHighRiskTargets\":[\"killer lock and transcript lifecycle; scheduled for the security pass\",\"packet requirements and evidence links; scheduled for the traceability pass\"],\"graphStatus\":\"unavailable\",\"semanticSearchStatus\":\"unavailable\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:555-585\"]},\"searchCoverage\":{\"requiredBugClasses\":[\"append_short_write_handling\",\"append_concurrency\",\"partial_tail_recovery\",\"state_directory_permissions\"],\"covered\":[\"append_short_write_handling\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"append_concurrency\",\"partial_tail_recovery\",\"state_directory_permissions\"],\"deferred\":[],\"blocked\":[\"graph_backed_coverage\"],\"graphCoverageMode\":\"graphless_fallback\"},\"searchLedger\":[{\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-001\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:555-585\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-810\"],\"bugClass\":\"append_short_write_handling\",\"hypothesis\":\"appendLog can report success when writeSync reports fewer bytes than requested.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:555-585\",\"result\":\"writeSync is called once and its byte count is ignored before fsync and successful return.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:580-585\"]},{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-810\",\"result\":\"Inspected append tests cover concurrency and partial tails; no forced short-write result appears in this range.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-810\"]}],\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"rationale\":\"The producer discards the returned byte count, so the short-write path can be reported as complete without its full event line.\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"LUNA-001\"},{\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-002\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:555-585\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-779\"],\"invariant\":\"Normal full writes from concurrent appenders remain separate complete log lines.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:567-581\",\"result\":\"The helper opens in append mode and emits each record through one write call.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:567-581\"]},{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-779\",\"result\":\"Test source starts eight processes with 25 appends each and checks 200 unique lines.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:749-779\"]}],\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\",\"rationale\":\"The inspected normal-write producer and concurrency test cover the selected concurrent-append invariant.\",\"ruledOutReason\":\"No race was identified in the inspected append-mode path for complete writes.\"},{\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-003\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:571-585\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:781-810\"],\"bugClass\":\"partial_tail_recovery\",\"invariant\":\"A prior unterminated tail does not merge the next appended event into that tail.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:571-585\",\"result\":\"The helper checks the final byte and prefixes a newline before the next event when needed.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:571-585\"]},{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:781-810\",\"result\":\"Test source exercises appending after an existing partial tail.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/relaunch-core.test.cjs:781-810\"]}],\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\",\"rationale\":\"The code and test source address the selected line-separation case.\",\"ruledOutReason\":\"The next append is separated from the previous unterminated tail.\"},{\"id\":\"LUNA-SL-004\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:42-46\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs:1392-1415\"],\"bugClass\":\"state_directory_permissions\",\"invariant\":\"The state directory is owner-only after creation and when reused.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:42-46\",\"result\":\"ensureStateDir creates recursively with mode 0700 and chmods the directory to 0700.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/lib/relaunch-core.cjs:42-46\"]},{\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/tests/killer.test.cjs:1392-1415\",\"result\":\"Test source as