+- Tracing the killer's crash paths found a leftover that no sweep owns and a freshness sign error; both are contained and fixable without changing the protocol (iteration 4).\n \n ## 8. Exhausted Approaches\n \n None.\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","time":{"start":1792422905375,"end":1792422905385}},"id":"prt_154bb035a001j26UK615qiOBQq","sessionID":"ses_eab5d5530ffemUeXMVtsM2xDB5","messageID":"msg_154bae874001rLB2099v2O8C5A"}}
