ayload parity for the broadened fifth pass.\n+Broadened pass: the adapter payload sources for the carried spec folder, the Claude/Codex nudge tests, the feature catalog and playbook claims, and the remaining documentation inputs. Do not re-enter the settled core, security, traceability, or lock findings.\n <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n \n ## 11. KNOWN CONTEXT\n \n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -74,9 +74,9 @@\n <!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out -->\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 10. NEXT FOCUS\n-Maintainability: stale-lock housekeeping, future-timestamp freshness, the cost of the duplicated handoff state, and the killer's remaining process-table paths. Keep the adapter payload parity for the broadened fifth pass.\n+Broadened pass: the adapter payload sources for the carried spec folder, the Claude/Codex nudge tests, the feature catalog and playbook claims, and the remaining documentation inputs. Do not re-enter the settled core, security, traceability, or lock findings.\n <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n \n ## 11. KNOWN CONTEXT\n \n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"specs/hooks/023-session