ad.\n+- No blocked protocol or blocked search class remains. The review used `graphless_fallback` because the lineage did not have a graph service; no graph-seed step was attempted, and the direct evidence is recorded instead.\n - The live-run raw log is not deferred; it is the P1 evidence gap.\n - The handoff notes themselves are gitignored local state and cannot be committed; the benchmark source explicitly records that boundary. The pane captures and the note status lines in the AC are the durable substitutes where present.\n - No tests or validators were run in this lineage; it is a read-only static review, and every finding carries a code or file citation rather than a test execution.\n \n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/review-report.md","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/review-report.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/review-report.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/148-session-relaunch-deep-review/specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/review-report.md\n@@ -266,9 +266,9 @@\n \n ## 8. Deferred Items\n \n - All ten P2 findings are active advisories; none is deferred.\n-- No blocked protocol or blocked search class remains. The only blocked item in the run was the graph-seed step, which the lineage-only write boundary made impossible; the review used `graphless_fallback` and recorded the direct evidence instead.\n+- No blocked protocol or blocked search class remains. The review used `graphless_fallback` because the lineage did not have a graph service; no graph-seed step was attempted, and the direct evidence is recorded instead.\n - The live-run raw log is not deferred; it is the P1 evidence gap.\n - The handoff notes themselves are gitignored local state and cannot be committed; the benchmark source explicitly records that boundary. The pane captures and the note status lines in the AC are the durable substitutes where present.\n - No tests or validators were run in this lineage; it is a read-only static review, and every finding carries a code or file citation rather than a test execution.\n \n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"specs/hooks/023-session-relaunch-loop/review/lineages/deepseek/review-report.md","time":{"start":1792423190299,"end":1792423190310}},"id":"prt_154bf5d15001qCp4TuakWC0oAT","sessionID":"ses_eab5d5530ffemUeXMVtsM2xDB5","messageID":"msg_154bf22a1001bILc6qd1qordfb"}}
